SUMMARY:Webinar 3: The Pressure To Perform: Navigating Expectations as a St
 udent
DESCRIPTION:[Webinar 3: The Pressure To Perform: Navigating Expectations as
  a Student 🧠💛]\n\nFeeling pressured to meet expectations\, keep up w
 ith academic demands\, and balance everything in university life? 📚😵
 💫\n\nJoin us for this insightful sharing session to explore the pressur
 es students face\, understand how expectations can affect our well-being\,
  and discover practical ways to cope with these challenges 🌱✨\n\nHere
  are the event details:\n📅 Date: 1 November 2026\n⏰ Time: 8.00 PM –
  10.00 PM\n💻 Platform: Cisco Webex\n💰 Fee: RM 1.00\n🎓 MyCSD: Prov
 ided\n🎤 Speaker: Muhammad Zulkarnain bin Johor\, MPP PPIP\n\nRemember\,
  you don't have to meet every expectation perfectly. Take a step back\, gi
 ve yourself some grace\, and learn how to navigate the pressure at your ow
 n pace. 🌿✨\n\n📝 Register here: https://forms.gle/kAzWoGyqaiWLnb4R6
 \n\n📞 For any inquiries:\nJulia – 011-6417 9735\nYue Tong – 018-763
  8153\n\n#ThePressureToPerform\n#StudentWellbeing\n#MentalHealthAwareness\
 n#UniversityLife\n#AssimilationWeek2627\n\nTime: 8.00 PM – 10.00 PM\n\nP
 latform: Cisco Webex\n\nRegistration: https://forms.gle/kAzWoGyqaiWLnb4R6\
 n\nSource: https://t.me/mycsd/44109
LOCATION:Cisco Webex
URL:https://forms.gle/kAzWoGyqaiWLnb4R6
