 nd discover how to become a true Wellness Warrior! 🏆💚\n\n📌 Here
 ’s what you need to know:\n\n📅 Date: 22 October – 20 December 2026\
 n💻 Platform: Online via Google Forms\n👥 Open to: All USM Students\n
